    "title": "GameSir VX2 COMBO AimSwitch Wireless Bluetooth Gaming Keyboard and Mouse Combo Adapter FPS for PlayStation 4/Xbox/PS3/PS4/Switch/PC (Black)",
    "body_html": "<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong></strong></span></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ejJiFe4V2bM?controls=0\" width=\"560\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div>\u00a0<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Gamesir vx2 combo aimswitch wireless bluetooth gaming keyboard and mouse combo adapter fps for playstation 4/xbox/ps3/ps4/switch/pc (black)\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_05-21-02.50.55.jpg?v=1621589631\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Gamesir vx2 combo aimswitch wireless bluetooth gaming keyboard and mouse combo adapter fps for playstation 4/xbox/ps3/ps4/switch/pc (black)\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_05-21-02.51.21.jpg?v=1621589645\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Gamesir vx2 combo aimswitch wireless bluetooth gaming keyboard and mouse combo adapter fps for playstation 4/xbox/ps3/ps4/switch/pc (black)\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_05-21-02.51.36.jpg?v=1621589661\">\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Key Features:\u00a0\u00a0</span></span></h1>\n<span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Support mainstream consoles: Xbox One, Xbox One S, Xbox One X, PS4, PS4 Pro, PS4 Slim, PlayStation 3, Nintento Switch and Windows PC</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Wireless connection:\u00a02nd Gen. Agility X 2.4GHz Receiver,\u00a0whose polling rate achieves up to 1000Hz, and is 8 times faster than that of\u00a0 1st generation.</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Backlight with 16.8 Million Color Options</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Full Keys Programmable via GameSir G-Crux,\u00a0including mouse sensitivity, smoothness, horizontal sensitivity, vertical sensitivity, ADS setting, deadzone setting and button setting.</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">36\u00a0TTC\u00a0Mechanical\u00a0Red\u00a0Switches</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">7-Key Roll-over with Anti-ghosting,\u00a0ALPS Ultra-thin 3D Joystick</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Compact\u00a0and\u00a0Portable\u00a0Design,\u00a0Aluminium Alloy\u00a0Top Plate</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><br>Package Contents:</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">1* GameSir VX2 AimSwitch Gaming Keypad<br><br>1* GameSir VX2 AimSwitch Receiver<br><br>1* GameSir GM400 Gaming Mouse<br><br>1* USB Type-C Cable<br><br>1* User Manual</span></span></p>\n\u00a0\n<p><br><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/AsGLydOMlf_7q59e_cxuxLUaVSK3i69_qBmo9NDGIsnVtn6dYAmunefvirhMuGbH02rxrBhZwwQOCckhzbwkh5DnYgy4zlIJAa-S77MyIPHytsbkJBqQtNU6URBYy6Zo-_dUMmPwoDxxEsz4CYRzYMKbcpqtF5N6GYZFDMVb3GVPC7agLLA2qckPhiLeEHUOobVycq4_os4cMlSGUso9IhUZ1HNe0BQVBsf8pd7DVfX9mWSncehjbGhOyAtO9qcmEDQZJCPNsRGARYHEnh6_sI97Cb18isdzAsHva0C9enDRY10FtnWCD8cRpwSOui5_WHzTmCr0oARMM3M1Eau0mIhcqY8qMZIbwwIgviSp588Wxt3iSQKdhJAEQbvIAHpFDwOc4HLI5qtkmifdSgxEr7lkUdcB6wrEkTUobfmmGApurJPT1iYTonA18xF5xOqV